gory description\">\n                        Reserve, then collect at the shop\n                    </p>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"tile block group\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1-2\" data-name=\"eighth category tile\" data-reveal=\"\" href=\"/retail?category=kaftans\" id=\"c-kaftans\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] bg-[var(--porcelain-200)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"eighth category image wrapper\">\n                        <img alt=\"Kaftans\" class=\"w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"eighth category image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/site/public/categories/kaftans.jpg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-5 flex items-baseline gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"eighth category title wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"tabular caption text-[var(--gold-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"eighth category index\">\n                            08\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"display h3 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"eighth category title\">\n                            Kaftans\n                        </h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"caption text-[var(--ink-400)] mt-1 pl-[2.6rem]\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1-2-3\" data-name=\"eighth category description\">\n                        Reserve, then collect at the shop\n                    </p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- 3. HOW RESERVING WORKS -->\n    <section class=\"relative bg-[var(--stage)] pt-36 pb-32\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"how it works section\">\n        <div class=\"edge\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-edge=\"#f2f1ec\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"torn paper edge separator\" data-reason=\"edge path generated and rendered by script on load\" data-seed=\"22\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shell-wide grid grid-cols-[35fr_65fr] gap-16 items-start\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"process content grid\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"process introduction column\">\n                <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"process section eyebrow\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                    How reserving works\n                </p>\n                <h2 class=\"display h2 mt-5 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"process section title\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                    <em data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"process section emphasis text\">\n                        Four\n                    </em>\n                    steps.\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-6 text-[var(--ink-600)] max-w-[36ch]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-3\" data-name=\"process section description\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                    Nothing is posted. The reservation holds the piece; the shop is where it finishes.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"process steps container\">\n                <div class=\"relative h-px bg-[var(--gold-600)]/50 mx-[10%]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step progress tracker line\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"absolute -top-2.5 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 text-[var(--gold-600)] text-[13px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"first step marker\">\n                        ✦\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"absolute -top-2.5 left-1/3 -translate-x-1/2 text-[var(--gold-600)] text-[13px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"second step marker\">\n                        ✦\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"absolute -top-2.5 left-2/3 -translate-x-1/2 text-[var(--gold-600)] text-[13px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"third step marker\">\n                        ✦\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"absolute -top-2.5 left-full -translate-x-1/2 text-[var(--gold-600)] text-[13px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"fourth step marker\">\n                        ✦\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <ol class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-4 gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"process steps list\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"first step item\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        <span class=\"tabular caption text-[var(--gold-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"first step index\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"display h3 mt-2 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"first step title\">\n                            Reserve online\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 caption text-[var(--ink-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"first step description\">\n                            Pick the piece and your size.\n                        </p>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"second step item\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        <span class=\"tabular caption text-[var(--gold-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"second step index\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"display h3 mt-2 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"second step title\">\n                            We hold it\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 caption text-[var(--ink-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"second step description\">\n                            It comes off the rail and waits for you.\n                        </p>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"third step item\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        <span class=\"tabular caption text-[var(--gold-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"third step index\">\n                            03\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"display h3 mt-2 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"third step title\">\n                            Come in and try it on\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 caption text-[var(--ink-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"third step description\">\n                            Fitting happens in the shop.\n                        </p>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"fourth step item\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        <span class=\"tabular caption text-[var(--gold-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"fourth step index\">\n                            04\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"display h3 mt-2 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"fourth step title\">\n                            Take it home\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 caption text-[var(--ink-600)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"fourth step description\">\n                            Pay at the shop, and it is yours.\n                        </p>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- 4. CROSS-SELL -->\n    <section class=\"relative grain on-dark bg-[var(--violet-950)] pt-32 pb-20\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-name=\"cross-sell section\">\n        <div class=\"edge\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-edge=\"#ecebe7\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"torn paper edge separator\" data-reason=\"edge path generated and rendered by script on load\" data-seed=\"23\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shell-wide relative grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-10\" data-kid=\"1-5-2\" data-name=\"cross-sell content grid\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow col-span-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"cross-sell section eyebrow\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                Rentals\n            </p>\n            <h3 class=\"display h3 col-span-5 text-[var(--porcelain-50)]\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"cross-sell title\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                For keeping, or for one week\n                <em data-kid=\"1-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cross-sell emphasis text\">\n                    only\n                </em>\n                .\n            </h3>\n            <a class=\"btn col-span-3 justify-self-end rounded-[10px] border border-[var(--porcelain-50)]/30 px-6 py-3 font-medium text-[var(--porcelain-50)] hover:border-[var(--porcelain-50)]/60\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-3\" data-name=\"rentals call-to-action button\" data-reveal=\"\" href=\"/rentals\">\n                See what is in for rent\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"col-span-2 justify-self-end\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-4\" data-name=\"cross-sell image wrapper\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                <img alt=\"A side lehenga for rent\" class=\"arch w-[112px] h-[140px] object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-4-1\" data-name=\"cross-sell image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/site/public/categories/side-lehengas.jpg\"/>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- 5. CLOSE -->\n    <section class=\"relative bg-[var(--porcelain-50)] pt-40 pb-32\" data-kid=\"1-6\" data-name=\"close section\">\n        <div class=\"edge\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-edge=\"#191129\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" data-name=\"torn paper edge separator\" data-reason=\"edge path generated and rendered by script on load\" data-seed=\"24\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shell-wide text-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-2\" data-name=\"close message container\">\n            <h2 class=\"display h2 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"close message title\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                Come in. It will be\n                <em data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-1\" data-name=\"close message emphasis text\">\n                    waiting\n                </em>\n                .\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shell-wide mt-16 grid grid-cols-3 gap-12 border-t border-[var(--ink-900)]/10 pt-12\" data-kid=\"1-6-3\" data-name=\"contact details grid\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-6-3-1\" data-name=\"hours info column\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-1\" data-name=\"hours label\">\n                    Hours\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"display h2 mt-3 text-[var(--ink-900)] tabular\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2\" data-name=\"hours text\">\n                    Mon–Sat, 11am – 8pm\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-6-3-2\" data-name=\"address info column\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-1\" data-name=\"address label\">\n                    Address\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-2\" data-name=\"address text\">\n                    Shop address, City\n                </p>\n                <a class=\"text-[var(--gold-600)] underline underline-offset-4 font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-3\" data-name=\"maps navigation link\" href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Vivaah+Dresses+and+Suits\">\n                    Open in Maps\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-6-3-3\" data-name=\"phone info column\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-1\" data-name=\"phone label\">\n                    Phone\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[var(--ink-900)]\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-2\" data-name=\"phone text\">\n                    +91 00000 00000\n                </p>\n                <a class=\"btn mt-6 inline-block rounded-[10px] bg-[var(--violet-800)] px-6 py-3 font-medium text-[var(--porcelain-50)] hover:bg-[var(--violet-700)]\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-3\" data-name=\"plan a visit button\" href=\"/visit\">\n                    Plan a visit\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- FOOTER (chrome) -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-[var(--violet-950)] text-[var(--violet-300)] on-dark\" data-kid=\"1-7\" data-name=\"main site footer\">\n        <div class=\"shell pt-20 pb-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n            <div class=\"col-span-5\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand column\">\n                <span class=\"display block text-[1.35rem] text-[var(--porcelain-50)]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">\n                    Vivaah\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"block text-[.5rem] tracking-[.22em] uppercase text-[var(--gold-500)] font-medium mt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer brand subtitle\">\n                    Dresses & Suits\n                </span>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 caption max-w-[30ch]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3\" data-name=\"footer description\">\n                    Bridal and festive wear to rent or buy, with jewellery to match.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-span-3\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2\" data-name=\"footer navigation column\">\n                <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer navigation title\">\n                    Explore\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"footer navigation list\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"footer rent link\">\n                        Rent\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"footer shop link\">\n                        Shop\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"footer jewellery link\">\n                        Jewellery\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"footer visit us link\">\n                        Visit us\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"footer rental terms link\">\n                        Rental terms\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-span-4\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3\" data-name=\"footer contact column\">\n                <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer visit us title\">\n                    Visit us\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] text-[var(--porcelain-50)]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer address text\">\n                    Shop address, City\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-3\" data-name=\"footer directions link\">\n                    Get directions\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-4\" data-name=\"footer hours text\">\n                    Mon–Sat, 11am – 8pm\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-5\" data-name=\"footer phone number\">\n                    +91 00000 00000\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 border-t border-[var(--porcelain-50)]/10 pt-6 flex justify-between caption\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4\" data-name=\"footer bottom row\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-1\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n                    © Vivaah Dresses and Suits. Reserve online, collect at our shop.\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2\" data-name=\"made in india credit\">\n                    Made for weddings, in India.\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    (function(){\n  // torn-paper edges: outgoing sheet hangs over incoming ground; hard edge, rolls with lit ridge.\n  function prng(s){let a=s>>>0;return()=>{a=(a+0x6d2b79f5)>>>0;let t=Math.imul(a^(a>>>15),1|a);t=(t+Math.imul(t^(t>>>7),61|t))^t;return((t^(t>>>14))>>>0)/4294967296}}\n  function mix(hex,k,to){const h=hex.replace('#','');const c=[0,2,4].map(i=>parseInt(h.substr(i,2),16));const t=to==='w'?[255,255,255]:[0,0,0];return'rgb('+c.map((v,i)=>Math.round(v*k+t[i]*(1-k))).join(',')+')'}\n  document.querySelectorAll('#vv .edge').forEach(el=>{\n    const paper=el.dataset.edge,seed=+el.dataset.seed,rnd=prng(seed),W=1600,H=160,TY=52,step=16,n=Math.ceil(W/step);\n    let w=0,ys=[];for(let i=0;i<=n;i++){w+=(rnd()-.5)*11;w=Math.max(-30,Math.min(30,w));const sp=rnd()<.08?(rnd()-.5)*34:0;ys.push(TY+w+(rnd()-.5)*13+sp)}\n    let tear=`M0 0 L${W} 0 L${W} ${ys[n]}`;for(let i=n-1;i>=0;i--)tear+=` L${i*step} ${ys[i]}`;tear+='Z';\n    let ts=`M0 ${ys[0]-6}`;for(let i=1;i<=n;i++)ts+=` L${i*step} ${ys[i]-6}`;for(let i=n;i>=0;i--)ts+=` L${i*step} ${ys[i]+9}`;ts+='Z';\n    const cnt=3+Math.floor(rnd()*2),curls=[];\n    for(let k=0;k<cnt;k++){const c=((k+.5)/cnt)*W+(rnd()-.5)*(W/cnt)*.4,half=38+rnd()*34,x0=Math.max(-40,c-half),x1=Math.min(W+40,c+half),depth=74+rnd()*26,lift=3+rnd()*4;\n      const iS=Math.max(0,Math.round(x0/step)),iE=Math.min(n,Math.round(x1/step));let top=`M${iS*step} ${ys[iS]}`;for(let i=iS+1;i<=iE;i++)top+=` L${i*step} ${ys[i]}`;\n      const belly=ys[Math.round((iS+iE)/2)]+depth;\n      const under=(o)=>` C ${x1-half*.06} ${ys[iE]+lift+depth*.55+o*.7}, ${c+half*.72} ${belly+o}, ${c} ${belly+o} C ${c-half*.72} ${belly+o}, ${x0+half*.06} ${ys[iS]+lift+depth*.55+o*.7}, ${iS*step} ${ys[iS]} Z`;\n      curls.push({d:top+under(0),s:top+under(11)})}\n    const id='e'+seed;\n    el.innerHTML=`<svg viewBox=\"0 0 ${W} ${H}\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"${id}\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"${mix(paper,.44,'b')}\"/><stop offset=\"14%\" stop-color=\"${mix(paper,.66,'b')}\"/><stop offset=\"26%\" stop-color=\"${mix(paper,.40,'w')}\"/><stop offset=\"33%\" stop-color=\"${mix(paper,.72,'w')}\"/><stop offset=\"46%\" stop-color=\"${paper}\"/><stop offset=\"72%\" stop-color=\"${mix(paper,.70,'b')}\"/><stop offset=\"92%\" stop-color=\"${mix(paper,.42,'b')}\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"${mix(paper,.30,'b')}\"/></linearGradient><filter id=\"${id}b\" x=\"-10%\" y=\"-30%\" width=\"120%\" height=\"180%\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"5\"/></filter></defs><path d=\"${tear}\" fill=\"${paper}\"/><g filter=\"url(#${id}b)\" opacity=\".22\"><path d=\"${ts}\" fill=\"#000\"/></g><g filter=\"url(#${id}b)\" opacity=\".28\">${curls.map(c=>`<path d=\"${c.s}\" fill=\"#000\"/>`).join('')}</g>${curls.map(c=>`<path d=\"${c.d}\" fill=\"url(#${id})\"/>`).join('')}</svg>`;\n  });\n\n  const reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const h1=document.getElementById('h1');\n  // split h1 into letters (keeps <em>)\n  (function split(node){Array.from(node.childNodes).forEach(ch=>{if(ch.nodeType===3){const f=document.createDocumentFragment();for(const c of ch.textContent){if(c===' '){f.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '))}else{const s=document.createElement('span');s.className='ch';s.textContent=c;f.appendChild(s)}}ch.replaceWith(f)}else split(ch)})})(h1);\n  if(reduce||typeof gsap==='undefined'){return}\n  document.getElementById('vv').classList.add('js');\n  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n  gsap.to('#vv .h1 .ch',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.7,ease:'power2.out',stagger:.018});\n  document.querySelectorAll('#vv [data-reveal]').forEach((el,i)=>{\n    gsap.to(el,{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.7,ease:'power2.out',delay:(i%4)*.07,scrollTrigger:{trigger:el,start:'top 80%',once:true}});\n  });\n  // letter ripple under pointer\n  h1.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{h1.querySelectorAll('.ch').forEach(s=>{const r=s.getBoundingClientRect();const d=Math.hypot(e.clientX-(r.left+r.width/2),e.clientY-(r.top+r.height/2));if(d<120)gsap.to(s,{y:-(1-d/120)*10,duration:.25,overwrite:'auto'});else gsap.to(s,{y:0,duration:.5,overwrite:'auto'})})});\n  h1.addEventListener('pointerleave',()=>gsap.to('#vv .h1 .ch',{y:0,duration:.5,overwrite:'auto'}));\n})();\n</script>\n",
